{"title": "Status groups", "pageid": 33194, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_groups", "categories": ["Lists", "Gameplay mechanics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Status groups</b> are groups a <a href=\"/wiki/Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition\">condition</a> may belong to. Status groups can define certain behavior for the conditions or simply be used as markers for interactions. For example <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a> makes conditions get removed if you <a href=\"/wiki/Respec\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Respec\">respec</a>, while <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Cursed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Cursed\">SG_Cursed</a> marks a condition for things like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/25px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/38px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/50px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Remove Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/25px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\">Remove Curse</a>.\n</p><p>Here is a list of all Status Groups. Click the links for their main pages containing all conditions that are part of them and everything that interacts with that status group.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Value</th>\n<th>Display Name</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr><tr id=\"SG_Approaching\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Approaching\" title=\"SG Approaching\">SG_Approaching</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Blinded\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(status_group)\" title=\"Blinded (status group)\">SG_Blinded</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(status_group)\" title=\"Blinded (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(status_group)\" title=\"Blinded (status group)\">Blinded</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>This group includes vision-impairing status similar to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>. While blinded by one of these conditions, many <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">reactions</a> will be unavailable such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/25px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/38px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/50px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellish Rebuke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/25px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\">Hellish Rebuke</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles\" title=\"Deflect Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/25px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/38px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/50px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deflect Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/25px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles\" title=\"Deflect Missiles\">Deflect Missiles</a>. Creatures who do not rely on vision will generally be immune to all blinding conditions.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_CanBePickedUp\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_CanBePickedUp\" title=\"SG CanBePickedUp\">SG_CanBePickedUp</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Charmed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">SG_Charmed</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this group are mental effects that influence how affected creatures act. The most severe of these conditions cause affected creatures to be completely controlled another creature.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Charmed_Subtle\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Charmed_Subtle\" title=\"SG Charmed Subtle\">SG_Charmed_Subtle</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Condition\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Condition\" title=\"SG Condition\">SG_Condition</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Confused\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Confused\" title=\"SG Confused\">SG_Confused</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Cursed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_(status_group)\" title=\"Cursed (status group)\">SG_Cursed</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_(status_group)\" title=\"Cursed (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_(status_group)\" title=\"Cursed (status group)\">Cursed</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>It is a group of magical conditions that hinder or harm during combat.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_DetectThoughts\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_DetectThoughts\" title=\"SG DetectThoughts\">SG_DetectThoughts</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_DifficultTerrain\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(status_group)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (status group)\">SG_DifficultTerrain</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this status group affect the entities' movement speed.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_DifficultTerrain\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(status_group)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (status group)\">SG_DifficultTerrain</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this status group affect the entities' movement speed.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Disease\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Diseased_(status_group)\" title=\"Diseased (status group)\">SG_Disease</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Diseased_(status_group)\" title=\"Diseased (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Diseased\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Diseased_(status_group)\" title=\"Diseased (status group)\">Diseased</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Diseases are often mundane in nature and can be cured on their own, or with the help of various potions and healing abilities.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Disguise\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Disguise\" title=\"SG Disguise\">SG_Disguise</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Dominated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Dominated\" title=\"SG Dominated\">SG_Dominated</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this status group generally grant control of the affected entity to whoever applied the condition.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Doppelganger\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Doppelganger\" title=\"SG Doppelganger\">SG_Doppelganger</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_DropForNonMutingDialog\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_DropForNonMutingDialog\" title=\"SG DropForNonMutingDialog\">SG_DropForNonMutingDialog</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this status group are temporarily disabled if the character with them is initiated in dialogue.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Drunk\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Drunk\" title=\"SG Drunk\">SG_Drunk</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Exhausted\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Exhausted\" title=\"SG Exhausted\">SG_Exhausted</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Fleeing\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Fleeing_(status_group)\" title=\"Fleeing (status group)\">SG_Fleeing</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this status group cause the affected entity to flee from whomever applied the condition.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Frightened\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">SG_Frightened</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> is the representative condition for the type. Conditions that inflict Frightened generally have the following effects:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Cannot move.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/34px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/45px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Ability checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack rolls</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Helpable_Condition\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Helpable_Condition\" title=\"SG Helpable Condition\">SG_Helpable_Condition</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this status group can be removed by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a></span> action.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_HexbladeCurse\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_HexbladeCurse\" title=\"SG HexbladeCurse\">SG_HexbladeCurse</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Ignore_AOO\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Ignore_AOO\" title=\"SG Ignore AOO\">SG_Ignore_AOO</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Incapacitated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">SG_Incapacitated</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitated</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>This status group includes any <a href=\"/wiki/Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition\">condition</a> that can alter or prevent the actions a character normally has available to them.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Invisible\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(status_group)\" title=\"Invisible (status group)\">SG_Invisible</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Light\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Light\" title=\"SG Light\">SG_Light</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Mad\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Mad\" title=\"SG Mad\">SG_Mad</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_None\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_None\" title=\"SG None\">SG_None</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Paralyzed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Paralyzed\" title=\"SG Paralyzed\">SG_Paralyzed</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Petrified\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(status_group)\" title=\"Petrified (status group)\">SG_Petrified</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(status_group)\" title=\"Petrified (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Petrified\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(status_group)\" title=\"Petrified (status group)\">Petrified</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this group incapacitate affected creatures through petrification.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Poisoned\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(status_group)\" title=\"Poisoned (status group)\">SG_Poisoned</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(status_group)\" title=\"Poisoned (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(status_group)\" title=\"Poisoned (status group)\">Poisoned</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> is the representative condition for the type.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Poisoned_Story_Nonremovable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Poisoned_Story_Nonremovable\" title=\"SG Poisoned Story Nonremovable\">SG_Poisoned_Story_Nonremovable</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Poisoned_Story_Removable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Poisoned_Story_Removable\" title=\"SG Poisoned Story Removable\">SG_Poisoned_Story_Removable</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Polymorph\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorphed (status group)\">SG_Polymorph</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorphed (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorphed (status group)\">Polymorphed</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a></span> is the representative condition for the type. This status group usually contains conditions that transform's the affected entities' body or shape.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Polymorph_BeastShape\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Beast_Shape_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorph Beast Shape (status group)\">SG_Polymorph_BeastShape</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Polymorph_BeastShape\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Beast_Shape_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorph Beast Shape (status group)\">SG_Polymorph_BeastShape</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Polymorph_BeastShape_NPC\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Polymorph_BeastShape_NPC\" title=\"SG Polymorph BeastShape NPC\">SG_Polymorph_BeastShape_NPC</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Possessed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Possessed_(status_group)\" title=\"Possessed (status group)\">SG_Possessed</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Prone\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(status_group)\" title=\"Prone (status group)\">SG_Prone</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(status_group)\" title=\"Prone (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(status_group)\" title=\"Prone (status group)\">Prone</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions that knock you prone, usually <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>, have the following effects:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Can't move or take <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a>, <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reactions</a>, and has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Strength and Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>Attacks against a Prone creature have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> if they're made within 3 m (10 ft) of the creature.</li>\n<li>A Prone creature must spend half its <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> to stand up.</li>\n<li>If you are <a href=\"/wiki/Concentrating\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Concentrating\">concentrating</a> on a spell, your concentration will automatically be broken when you get knocked <b>Prone</b>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Rage\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Rage\" title=\"SG Rage\">SG_Rage</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_RemoveOnRespec\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this status group are removed if the character they are on is <a href=\"/wiki/Respec\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Respec\">respecced</a>.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Restrained\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(status_group)\" title=\"Restrained (status group)\">SG_Restrained</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>This group encompasses conditions which physically impair a creature's movement.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_ScriptedPeaceBehaviour\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_ScriptedPeaceBehaviour\" title=\"SG ScriptedPeaceBehaviour\">SG_ScriptedPeaceBehaviour</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Sleeping\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Sleeping\" title=\"SG Sleeping\">SG_Sleeping</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Stunned\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(status_group)\" title=\"Stunned (status group)\">SG_Stunned</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(status_group)\" title=\"Stunned (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(status_group)\" title=\"Stunned (status group)\">Stunned</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Conditions in this group generally prevent affected creatures from taking any type of actions.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Surface\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Surface\" title=\"SG Surface\">SG_Surface</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Taunted\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_Taunted\" title=\"SG Taunted\">SG_Taunted</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_Unconscious\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Unconscious_(status_group)\" title=\"Unconscious (status group)\">SG_Unconscious</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unconscious_(status_group)\" title=\"Unconscious (status group)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unconscious\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Unconscious_(status_group)\" title=\"Unconscious (status group)\">Unconscious</a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"SG_WeaponCoating\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/SG_WeaponCoating\" title=\"SG WeaponCoating\">SG_WeaponCoating</a>\n</p>\n</th>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>-\n</p>\n</td>\n\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195832\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.092 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.102 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3594/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 57178/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11976/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 853490/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.995      1 -total\n 46.12%   29.973     13 Template:Icon_link\n 44.61%   28.993     13 Template:Icon_text\n 36.53%   23.741     26 Template:Trim\n 35.06%   22.789     49 Template:Status_groups_table/row\n 22.21%   14.436     13 Template:Ifempt